            "review_text": "Sandrine et Laurent\nSchengen, Luxembourg636 contributions\n0\nNice!\nJul 2026 • Family\nWe found this welcoming terrace by chance, beautiful outdoor furniture, beautiful lighting, good atmosphere.\nWe had a drink and a small snack to nibble on.\nThe latter was excellent and we decided to have dinner there.\nOur dishes were excellent.\nTop-notch service! \nWe had a very good time there.\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten July 13, 2026",
