            "review_title": "Review at RuNam Bitexco",
            "review_text": "Claude G\nTaverny, France665 contributions\n1\nRefreshing discovery\nMay 2026 • Couples\nEven though the surroundings of the Bitexco Tower are very busy, the terrace of this establishment, slightly elevated at the corner of two streets, is calm, well-ventilated, and comfortable. Discovered by chance during a walk when it was particularly hot, we enjoyed two very cold beers there, and we will undoubtedly return during our year-end stay.\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten June 1, 2026",
