            "review_text": "pakabay\nAdelaide, Australia3025 contributions\n0\nFantastic Cafe & Staff\nNov 2025 • Couples\nAfter an exhausting day wandering around Saigon, we settled into the plush surroundings of this rather special cafe/restaurant.\n\nWe’ve only visited Saigon/Ho Chi Minh City twice and have enjoyed a visit here on both occasions.\n\nThe store presents so well, particularly with the Christmas items featured.\n\nThe menu is extensive, both for food & drink, and reasonably priced, given the standards here.\n\nAnd the young team were courteous, informative and super professional. An excellent experience, thank you.\nRead more\nWritten November 20, 2025",
