            "review_text": "mion369\nGrobbendonk, Belgium865 contributions\n0\nVietnamese/European\nApr 2025 • Couples\nChic restaurant, smooth service. The menu is a mix of Vietnamese and European, you have a great choice and you are sure to find something to your taste. On the terrace you have a view of a few streets of Ho Chi Minh City, a procession of people, scooters and cars passes by all evening. Here you see almost no tourists, so you really feel in Vietnam.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Dutch\nShow original\nWritten April 11, 2025",
